{"3922710": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wood's Enchantment", "steam_appid": 3922710, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WARNING: THIS GAME CONTAINS BUGS. IT WILL BE FIXED AND REBUILT LATER! ! !</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Warning: this game is intentionally difficult!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this gripping narrative game blending exploration and chills</strong>, you play as Alexis-Philippe, an urban exploration enthusiast in search of thrills and forgotten places. Your curiosity leads you to the decaying gates of an abandoned hospital, lost deep within a dense and silent forest—forgotten by all… or almost all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What was meant to be a simple nighttime exploration quickly turns into a true nightmare. The air is heavy, thick with a troubled past and barely audible whispers. Dark hallways, operating rooms frozen in time, scattered medical records… Every room hides a fragment of a chilling story you’ll need to piece together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be warned: within these time-worn walls, some secrets don’t want to be uncovered. The hospital feels alive, aware of your presence. The further you go, the more tangible the danger becomes. Will you find your way out before it’s too late?<br>Or will you become trapped in this cursed place… forever?</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WARNING: THIS GAME CONTAINS BUGS. IT WILL BE FIXED AND REBUILT LATER! ! !</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Warning: this game is intentionally difficult!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this gripping narrative game blending exploration and chills</strong>, you play as Alexis-Philippe, an urban exploration enthusiast in search of thrills and forgotten places. Your curiosity leads you to the decaying gates of an abandoned hospital, 